              "text": "write response to this \n\nDear Mr. Ameer,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. It was a genuine pleasure meeting you in Amman, and I wanted to follow up on our conversation from Tuesday.\n\nOur discussion around Insider's ESG platform was both insightful and encouraging. Walking through the platform's architecture, modules, and core functionality gave me a clear picture of the value it can deliver to organizations looking to strengthen their ESG practices. It is evident that the platform is well-positioned to address the growing compliance and reporting demands that many of our clients in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia (KSA) are now facing.\n\nGiven the alignment between Insider's capabilities and the needs of our client base in KSA \u2014 particularly in light of Vision 2030 sustainability goals \u2014 I believe there is a meaningful opportunity for us to collaborate and bring this solution to market together.\n\nAs a next step, I would like to propose a follow-up meeting to discuss a potential partnership framework and define what a collaboration could look like in practice. I am available on:\n\n\u00a0 \u2022 Monday, 6th April 2026 at 11:00 AM\n\u00a0 \u2022 Tuesday, 7th April 2026 at 11:00 AM\n\nPlease let me know which date works best for you, and whether you would prefer the meeting to be held virtually or in person. I am happy to accommodate your preference.\n\nLooking forward to continuing the conversation.\n\nBest regards,",
              "type": "MESSAGE_TYPE_HUMAN",
